  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow></math><br />For <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be defined, we have<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Which is only possible if<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Also these values satisfies the equation<br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Number of solutions <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
